=2 Walkthrough
!Rarcasmeult-map.jpg|right|Rarcasmeult map
* Speak to {n:Rarcasmeult} (J-6 2nd map and off in uncharted H-6/I-6, top right hand corner of map) and he will tell you to find the Firesand Storeroom.
* Return through the door from whence you came and venture South.
* Continue South past {n:Loutille} and then past {n:Duchille}, go through the Heavy Iron Gate. __Slimes and Bats will aggro in this section, so be sure to have {s:Sneak} or {i:Silent Oil|Silent Oil|4165} handy.__
* Head south and west towards the square section of this map, then continue heading towards (G-7) where you will find a **Storeroom Door**.
* Enter the Storeroom, then examine the **???** on a nearby table to receive {@k} {k:Firepower case}.
* Return to {n:Rarcasmeult} to obtain your reward.

